## 4. Flujo de una petición

```text
HTTP request
  -> platform/security/JwtAuthenticationFilter (valida Bearer y puebla SecurityContext)
  -> platform/security/SecurityConfig (autoriza por URL y rol)
  -> backend/api-rest/controllers/{rest|cases|auth}/*
  -> backend/api-core/services/core/{crud|cases|integracion}/*CoreService
  -> backend/api-core/maps/specific/*Map (input -> DTO y DTO -> Output)
  -> backend/api-base/rest/services/*Service (CRUD transaccional)
  -> backend/api-base/mapping/*Mapper (MapStruct, Entity <-> DTO)
  -> backend/api-base/persistence/repositories/*Repository
  -> backend/api-base/persistence/entities/*Entity
  -> MySQL

Respuesta:
Entity -> DTO (MapStruct) -> Output record (GlobalMapper) -> JSON
```

### Pila por entidad

```yaml
entity_stack:
  Entity: backend/api-base/src/main/java/ufps/edu/co/persistence/entities/XEntity.java
  Repository: backend/api-base/src/main/java/ufps/edu/co/persistence/repositories/XRepository.java
  DTO: backend/api-base/src/main/java/ufps/edu/co/rest/dto/XDTO.java
  Service: backend/api-base/src/main/java/ufps/edu/co/rest/services/XService.java
  Mapper: backend/api-base/src/main/java/ufps/edu/co/mapping/XMapper.java   # MapStruct
  Input records: backend/api-core/src/main/java/ufps/edu/co/records/input/entity/XInput.java
  Output record: backend/api-core/src/main/java/ufps/edu/co/records/output/entity/XOutput.java
  Map: backend/api-core/src/main/java/ufps/edu/co/maps/specific/XMap.java
  CoreService: backend/api-core/src/main/java/ufps/edu/co/services/core/crud/XCoreService.java
  Controller: backend/api-rest/src/main/java/ufps/edu/co/controllers/rest/XRestController.java
```

### Mapeo: dos capas distintas

| Capa | Mecanismo | Dónde | Qué hace |
|---|---|---|---|
| Entity ↔ DTO | **MapStruct 1.6.3** | `api-base/mapping` | `EntityMapper<E,D>` con `toDto`/`toEntity`; `MapStructConfig` fija `componentModel=SPRING`, inyección por constructor y `unmappedTargetPolicy=ERROR`. `GenericService` inyecta el mapper según los tipos genéricos. |
| Input → DTO / DTO → Output | `GlobalMapper` / `UniversalMapper` | `api-core/maps` | `GlobalMapper` despacha según el record de entrada; `UniversalMapper` auto-mapea por reflexión con `@UniversalMapping`; los `*Map` específicos completan las reglas no triviales. |

**ModelMapper ya no existe** en el proyecto. Si aparece una referencia, es documentación vieja.

